### Documentation website ###
docs/node_modules/
docs/.vuepress/.cache/
docs/.vuepress/.temp/
docs/.vuepress/dist/
# Generated by `mise run docs-roadmap` from roadmap.yml, which is canonical.
docs/project/roadmap.md

# Local performance measurements and profiling evidence
/benchmark-results/
/fuzz-results/
/testdata/performance/results/

# Binaries that `go build` drops into an example module when run there.
/examples/*/sigilc
/examples/*/deploygate

